# Track code, small metadata and attribution only. Model/collision payloads,
# including JSON prefab triangle arrays, belong to the local asset library.
*
!*/
!.gitignore
!shaders/**
!**/*.md
!**/*license*.txt
!**/*License*.txt
!**/*LICENSE*.txt
!**/licenses/*.txt
!**/*provenance*.json
!**/*manifest.json
!models/*-bounds.json
!settlements/templates.json
!furnishings/catalog.json
!furnishings/interiors.json
